stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending : User submits request<br/>(valid pet available, no duplicate pending)

    Pending --> Approved : Admin approves
    Pending --> Rejected : Admin rejects

    Approved --> PetAdopted : pet.adopted = true, pet.status = "adopted"
    Approved --> NotifyDecision : Notification created for applicant
    Rejected --> NotifyDecision : Notification created for applicant

    Pending --> Deleted : Admin deletes request
    Deleted --> [*]
    NotifyDecision --> [*]

    note right of Pending
        createAdoption validates:
        - pet exists
        - status === "available" and not adopted
        - no existing Pending request from this user
    end note